<div class="modal fade" id="modal-idigbio-recordset-not-match" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-label" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title" id="modal-label">Recordset ID not matched
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
        </button>
        </h5>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>The iDigBio record associated with this occurrence ID has a collection recordset ID that is different from the associated MorphoSource organization’s recordset ID. If you believe you are receiving this message in error, please contact the <a href="mailto:morphosource@duke.edu">MorphoSource admins</a>.</p>
        <p>If you click Save, any pending edits to the specimen will still be saved, but the specimen will not be updated to match the iDigBio record and any changes to the occurrence ID will not be saved. You can also click Cancel and return to the edit page.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button id="btn-save" type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
